  - title: LEVEL 11 | Wiring Guide
    explanation: Battery+ -> switch -> positive distribution node. Connect EACH resistor
      input to that node and EACH output to common Battery_negative. Never place
      the three resistors in series.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | STEP-BY-STEP CONNECTIONS
    parts:
